Umbrella entry point for the Lean companion of the second-moment analysis of
the Stratonovich hyperbolic Anderson model. It imports every proof module;
import a single `StratonovichHAMAudit.<Seam>` module to use one seam alone.

Scope: finite, algebraic and scalar deductions only. The SPDE, stochastic
integrals, Gaussian measures and the analytic inputs named in each module's
hypotheses are outside Lean; see FORMALIZATION.md.
-/
